I think the bigger visual gain is better car detail, track texture, and maybe grandstands. The current scene is clean and pretty. Let's not clutter.

Add second tree layer at 2.4 width far for depth; use same trees? Could add 40 large background trees. Maybe skip.

Add a marshal post / advertising arch? We have the gantry at start.

Add a big "PARABOLICA" banner? Not.

